WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.350
Each rate card becomes a rule, and the rules cross at one usage.

2
00:00:05.176 --> 00:00:09.226
Plan A is a daily charge plus a rate for each unit used.

3
00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:13.430
Plan B has a lower daily charge and a higher rate.

4
00:00:14.233 --> 00:00:18.758
At twelve units a day they match. Below that B wins, above that A wins.
